sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Hook as Keyboard Hook
    participant UIM as UserInputManager
    participant ETE as EventTokenEngine
    participant Reader as WordProgramReader
    participant Word as Word COM
    participant TTS as TextToSpeech

    User->>Hook: Press Ctrl+Right
    Hook->>UIM: KeyPressed event
    UIM->>ETE: GetToken(UserInput)
    ETE-->>UIM: CancellationToken
    UIM->>UIM: Task.Run(process key)
    UIM->>Reader: Raise OnKeyPressed("Ctrl+Right")
    Reader->>Reader: Find method with [OnKeyPressed("Ctrl+Right")]
    Reader->>Reader: Invoke NextWord()
    Reader->>Word: Selection.MoveRight(wdWord, 1)
    Word-->>Reader: Success
    Reader->>Word: Selection.Text
    Word-->>Reader: "hello"
    Reader->>TTS: Speak("hello")
    TTS->>User: Audio: "hello"
